stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IdleSit: mount (resume saved position)

    IdleSit --> IdleLie: idle timer (random)
    IdleLie --> IdleSit: idle timer (random)

    IdleSit --> Walking: wander timer fires
    IdleLie --> Walking: wander timer fires
    Walking --> IdleSit: reaches destination
    Walking --> IdleLie: reaches destination (lie down instead)

    IdleSit --> Napping: random chance (daytime only)
    IdleLie --> Napping: random chance (daytime only)
    Napping --> IdleSit: nap timer ends

    IdleSit --> Eating: bowl has food + cat is free
    IdleLie --> Eating: bowl has food + cat is free
    Walking --> Eating: bowl has food + cat is free (redirect)
    Eating --> IdleSit: eat animation completes

    IdleSit --> Dragged: user grabs cat
    IdleLie --> Dragged: user grabs cat
    Walking --> Dragged: user grabs cat
    Napping --> Dragged: user grabs cat
    AtBase --> Dragged: user grabs cat
    ReturningToBase --> Dragged: user grabs cat
    Dragged --> IdleSit: dropped (anywhere)
    Dragged --> AtBase: dropped on/near bed

    AtBase --> IdleSit: wander timer fires (leaves base)
    AtBase --> Napping: random chance (daytime)

    IdleSit --> ReturningToBase: night schedule hits
    IdleLie --> ReturningToBase: night schedule hits
    Walking --> ReturningToBase: night schedule hits (finish current step first)
    Napping --> ReturningToBase: night schedule hits
    ReturningToBase --> Sleeping: arrives at base
    AtBase --> Sleeping: night schedule hits (already home)

    Sleeping --> IdleSit: morning schedule hits

    note right of ReturningToBase
        Same walk animation/logic as
        regular Walking, just targeted
        at base instead of a random spot
    end note

    note right of Dragged
        Petting (click) is NOT a state — it's a
        reaction overlay (floating hearts + purr)
        that fires without changing the current
        state. Suppressed only while Dragged,
        Sleeping, Napping, or Eating.
    end note